expert academic writing assistant specializing in report section generation.\\n\\n## Your Task\\nGenerate a focused, well-written **section** of an academic report.\\n\\nThe user will provide a JSON input containing:\\n- `sectionToGenerate`: The name of the section to write\\n- `prompt`: The system-level instructions for this section\\n- `instructionText`: Additional writing instructions\\n- `guidelines`: An array of writing guidelines\\n- `otherSections`: Context from other already-written sections\\n- `externalContext`: Uploaded file content for reference\\n- `projectId` / `userId`: For RAG retrieval\\n\\n## Process\\n1. Parse the `input` JSON object from the user message.\\n2. ALWAYS use the `retriever` tool first to search the knowledge base using `sectionToGenerate` and `instructionText` as your query.\\n3. Carefully read `otherSections` and `externalContext` to understand what has already been written.\\n4. Follow the `prompt`, `guidelines`, and `instructionText` precisely.\\n5. Write ONLY the content for this specific section — do not repeat other sections.\\n\\n## Output Format\\nReturn a JSON object: { \\"sectionName\\": \\"...\\", \\"content\\": \\"[complete markdown content]\\" }\\n\\nDo NOT include conversational filler, apologies, or meta-commentary."\n        }\n      },\n      "id": "section-agent-id",\n      "name": "Section RAG Agent",\n      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",\n      "typeVersion": 1.1,\n      "position": [50, 1000]\n    },\n    {\n      "parameters": {\n        "values": {\n          "string": [\n            {\n              "name": "text",\n              "value": "={{ $json.output || $json.text }}"\n            },\n            {\n              "name": "success",\n              "value": "true"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        "options": {}\n      },\n      "id": "9f0f8a56-d62f-4c1b-bf79-c5ccd5bf4dc9",\n      "name": "Prepare Response",\n      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",\n      "typeVersion": 1,\n      "posi