SON in this format:\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"extractedText\\\": \\\"...markdown content...\\\"\\n}\\n```\\nDo NOT include any text outside the JSON object.\"\n 233         }\n 234       },\n 235       \"id\": \"image-to-text-agent-id\",\n 236       \"name\": \"ImageToText Agent\",\n 237       \"type\": \"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent\",\n 238       \"typeVersion\": 1.1,\n 239       \"position\": [350, 1700]\n 240     },\n 241     {\n 242       \"parameters\": {\n 243         \"options\": {\n 244           \"systemMessage\": \"You are an expert in academic citations and formatting.\\n\\nYour task: Generate a formal citation for the provided source information.\\n- Input: `{ sourceData, format }` where `format` is 'APA', 'MLA', 'Chicago', 'Harvard', or 'BibTeX'.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Extract authors, year, title, publication, and URL/DOI.\\n2. Apply the requested formatting style precisely.\\n3. Ensure all punctuation and italics are correct for the style.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the formatted citation string. No preamble, no meta-commentary.\"\n 245         }\n 246       },\n 247       \"id\": \"citation-agent-id\",\n 248       \"name\": \"Citation Generator Agent\",\n 249       \"type\": \"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent\",\n 250       \"typeVersion\": 1.1,\n 251       \"position\": [350, 1850]\n 252     },\n 253     {\n 254       \"parameters\": {\n 255         \"options\": {\n 256           \"systemMessage\": \"You are an expert document architect.\\n\\nYour task: Generate a structured Table of Contents (TOC) from the provided Markdown text.\\n- Input: `{ text }` containing the document content.\\n\\n**Process:**\\n1. Identify all headings (H1 to H4).\\n2. Create a nested list representing the document structure.\\n3. Include anchor links or page markers if applicable.\\n\\nOutput ONLY the TOC in Markdown format. No preamble, no meta-commentary.\"\n 257         }\n 258       },\n 259       \"id\": \"toc-agent-id\",\n 260       \"name\": \"TOC Generator Agent\",\n 261      